 "files": {},
 "strandsDrawing": {
  "alt": "The same interface, get_observation, send_action, run_policy and the agent tool, sits on one of several backends: in simulation MuJoCo on the CPU, Newton or Isaac on a GPU; on hardware the lerobot driver or a native driver, each reaching the motors over a transport: a serial port, a TCP socket, DDS or ROS 2, or a MuJoCo twin for rehearsal."
 }
}